SUMMARY:🧠🍺 Tuesday Trivia Night at Beer Study
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLet’s put all those random facts y
 ou’ve accumulated over the years to work.\n\nJoin us for craft beer\, tr
 ivia\, and good company at Beer Study. Questions range from pop culture an
 d music to history\, science\, geography\, and everything in between. Triv
 ia fills up quickly\, so we’ll arrive a little early to grab seats and f
 orm teams.\n\nNo trivia experience required. Just bring your brain\, your 
 sense of humor\, and maybe that one friend who somehow knows every answer.
  🍻🧠
